            <title>[KYLIN-5365] check-1700-spark-kystorage.sh should print detail error message when the queue of query is incorrect</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5365</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When the setup environment is a Read-Write-Separation, when executing the check shell `./sbin/check-1700-spark-kystorage.sh`,  set a wrong queue just throws NPE other than detail error message.   &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13053878/13053878_5365.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, `./sbin/check-1601-spark-queue.sh &apos; has detail error message.&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13053879/13053879_5365-2.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</description>
